  "limits": [
    "Ownership is explicit per physically inspected native pose, never nearest-neighbor allocation. Isolated tiny pixel clusters listed with each figure are specular/contour islands inside that figure, not new pose bodies.",
    "The earlier left-a-v1-held-wrong-facing.png is excluded in full and retained only as source history.",
    "Root must independently inspect facing, handed equipment, contralateral walking and KO/roll anatomy before admitting these candidates. No pose is silently relabelled or mirrored.",
    "Seven candidate source PNGs contain46 physical figures:32 selected roles,7neutralcalibrations and7heldfigures. Temporal phase reuse never inflates this into72bodies.",
    "The six-figure gait page is partially retained for A and its own neutral only; both failed B drawings remain held. The four-figure page supplies B and independent neutrals only after Root paired gait review.",
    "Do not use one source-frame height for both faces of a shared atlas: candidate direct neutral heights are462/456forwalkAand481/472forwalkB. Use disjoint logical source descriptors if renderer calibration is keyed by asset name."
  ],
